@baseUrl = https://localhost:7026

### UC01 - Register Student
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "student@test.com",
  "password": "Student@123",
  "fullName": "Test Student",
  "studentCode": "SE123456",
  "phone": "0901111111"
}

### UC01 - Register duplicate email (expect 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "student@test.com",
  "password": "Student@123",
  "fullName": "Duplicate",
  "studentCode": "SE999999"
}

### UC02 - Login Admin
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@fpt.edu.vn",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}

### UC02 - Login wrong password (expect 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@fpt.edu.vn",
  "password": "WrongPassword"
}

### UC03 - Get profile (requires token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/account/me
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}
Accept: application/json

### UC03 - Get profile as XML (Content Negotiation)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/account/me
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}
Accept: application/xml

### UC03 - Get profile with CSV accept (expect 406)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/account/me
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}
Accept: text/csv

### UC09 - List users (Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users?search=&page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

### UC10 - List locations (anonymous)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/locations
Accept: application/json

### UC10 - List locations as XML
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/locations
Accept: application/xml

### UC10 - List organizers
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/organizers
